# ReadIntArray.srv — 读一整组 int64 值(板载按键 / 蓝牙手柄)。
# Spec: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-09-ros2-layering-interfaces-design.md §6
#
# std_srvs/Trigger 响应只有 bool+string,装不下 int64[] —— 故用自定义 srv。
# source: "key" → board_key, "pad" → bluetooth_pad。

string source         # "key" | "pad"
---
bool ok
string error
int64[] values
